decomposition has the corner data `w5r_CornerData` (turn-preserving bijection of the noncontact corners of
`q_H` with those of `L₁ ⊕ L₂`; contact turns `s₀`, `s₀` on the halves and `±s₀` on `q_H` by `ε`). -/
theorem w5r_box_corners : ∃ δ : ℝ, 0 < δ ∧ ∀ t : g.SideParameter, t.val < δ →
    ∀ T₀ ∈ w4_EligDec hn g h t, w5r_CornerData hn g h h₁ h₂ t T₀ := by
  sorry

/-- **BLACK BOX (unit W5-SITE — the contact carrier pair)**: below a radius, every eligible decomposition has
BLOCK's `s7k_ContactRowData` at `q_H, q_L, x` (`w5r_ContactData`): the bigon site with the reduced record of
the low lift (SITE + SITEH) and the full rotation through the wall. -/
theorem w5r_box_contact : ∃ δ : ℝ, 0 < δ ∧ ∀ t : g.SideParameter, t.val < δ →
    ∀ T₀ ∈ w4_EligDec hn g h t, ∀ hT : IsDecomposition hn (s7f_hP₂ g M a t) (s7f_lift hn g h t T₀),
